{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:0": "Great！心情真不錯啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:1": "怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "你已經被包圍了",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "乖乖投降吧～",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "管不了那麼多了。開槍！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "這、這是什麼怪物……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "撤、撤退！\n撤──退！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/02 Before Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "這裡好像很好玩嘛？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/03 After Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "哼！想逃嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/03 After Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "終於找到你了。\n究極的破壞之神『卡歐斯』啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/03 After Chaos 0 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "哇～哈哈哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/04 Before Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:0": "嗯？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/04 Before Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:1": "塔爾斯？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/04 Before Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:2": "喂喂！\n那樣會掉下來的啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/04 Before Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:3": "塔爾斯……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/04 Before Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:4": "真拿你沒辦法，受不了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:0": "話說回來，\n我們真的好久不見了耶！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:1": "是啊，差不多吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:10": "嗯！\n我拿到了七顆之中的一顆。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:12": "能產生無限力量的神奇寶石……。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:13": "我在想，能不能想辦法\n把它當成動力來源。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:14": "對了，來我的工作室吧！\n我也有東西想給你看。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:16": "就在神祕遺跡那邊。\n從車站搭火車一下子就到了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:2": "先別說這個……你怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:3": "竟然會讓飛機墜毀，\n一點都不像你啊，塔爾斯。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:4": "我正在測試新型飛機。\n傳動系統的強度好像不太夠。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:6": "要飛機的話，\n不是有寄放在你那裡的龍捲風號嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:7": "嘿嘿，這次我在構思\n更厲害的東西喔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:8": "也是因為這個……你看！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:9": "混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "哇～哈哈哈！\n索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "你是……\n蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "否則的話，你想怎樣？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "我就用武力搶過來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "沒錯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "我就是這世上無人能比的\n天才科學家，蛋頭博士大人！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "……好久不見啦。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "我是安分了好一陣子。\n不過接下來又要開始忙囉。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "你又打算做什麼壞事了吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "這次我絕對不會讓你們礙事！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/06 Before Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "乖乖交出混沌翡翠就算了。\n否則的話……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "光會耍嘴皮子嘛！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "破綻百出！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "我要利用牠\n摧毀車站廣場……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "然後在那裡建造我理想中的城市──\n蛋頭樂園！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "哇哈哈哈哈！好，卡歐斯！\n出發去找下一顆翡翠吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:16": "要是那個怪物一直變身下去，\n事情就糟糕了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:17": "可惡的蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:18": "只要不讓牠拿到翡翠，\n牠應該就沒辦法再變身了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:19": "索尼克！我們搶先一步\n去收集混沌翡翠吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "好，卡歐斯！\n收下這個吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "卡歐斯……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "那是之前那傢伙……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "喔喔！就跟石板上記載的一樣！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "哇哈哈哈，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "這個卡歐斯每得到一顆混沌翡翠，\n就會變身得更加強大",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/07 After Egg Hornet Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "只要集齊全部７顆翡翠，\n牠就會成長為究極的怪物！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/08 Now you've got Light Speed Shoes/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「光速鞋」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/08 Now you've got Light Speed Shoes/Japanese.txt:1": "只要按住動作鈕不放，\n就能累積力量。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/08 Now you've got Light Speed Shoes/Japanese.txt:2": "累積力量之後再放開按鍵，\n就能使出光速衝刺喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/08 Now you've got Light Speed Shoes/Japanese.txt:4": "光速衝刺能朝著金環\n以光速移動，所以……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/08 Now you've got Light Speed Shoes/Japanese.txt:5": "只要金環連成一線，\n不管哪裡都能去喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "哎呀！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "糟了！\n混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:2": "看招！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:3": "哇啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:4": "哇──哈哈哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/09 After Casinopolis (1)/Japanese.txt:5": "可……惡，蛋頭博士……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/10 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克，混沌翡翠呢……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/10 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "被搶走了一顆……\n不過之前拿到的那顆還在。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/10 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "……那傢伙也真拚命啊。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/10 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "這麼一來，翡翠就是\n蛋頭博士兩顆、我們一顆了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/10 After Casinopolis (2)/Japanese.txt:4": "我們可不能輸啊，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/11 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "納克魯斯！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/11 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "你幹什麼！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/11 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "少囉唆！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/11 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "把那顆翡翠\n交給我！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/11 Before Knuckles Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "什麼！休想！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "呵呵呵……這樣就第４顆了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "卡歐斯──！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:13": "又變身了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "哼，\n還真是個急性子的傢伙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "哼……蠢貨，竟然被我的花言巧語給騙了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "那是……混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "我也想輕鬆一點嘛。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "你的個性，\n就讓我好好利用了一番！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "這是怎麼回事？\n難道說、該不會、莫非……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "你又被蛋頭博士騙了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "少、少囉唆！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/12 Before Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "該說你單純，還是什麼好呢……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "看到了吧！\n這就是我的萬能空中要塞──蛋頭母艦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "卡歐斯的力量\n可不只這點程度！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "ＯＫ，納克魯斯！\n那種傢伙，我們自己對付就夠了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "好……我們走！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "我們後會有期！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "索尼克，我們追上去！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "我的研究室就在附近，\n把龍捲風號開出來吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "好！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "索尼克……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "我還有別的事要做。\n抱歉，我只能陪你們到這裡。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/13 After Chaos 4 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "這樣啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/14 Before Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克，等我一下！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/14 Before Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:1": "來，上來吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/14 Before Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:2": "好～那我們出發囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/15 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:1": "塔爾斯～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/15 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:2": "什麼嘛，不在啊……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/15 After Sky Chase Act 1/Japanese.txt:3": "他不會有事吧……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:1": "好久不見～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:2": "艾、艾咪！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:3": "等一下！\n你那是什麼態度啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:4": "吶，這隻小鳥被人追著跑耶！\n你就當一下下保鑣嘛？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:6": "什麼！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/16 Meeting Amy/Japanese.txt:7": "就算你說不行，\n我也要跟著你！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:0": "來了！是蛋頭博士的機器人！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:1": "哼，那種傢伙\n我三兩下就能解決掉。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:2": "哇啊──！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:3": "怎、怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:4": "唔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:5": "好棒喔！上面寫「情侶優惠！\n帥氣情侶免費入場」耶！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:6": "吶吶，我們進去嘛！\n好不好，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:7": "艾咪！等一下啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/17 Before Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:8": "真是的，拿妳沒辦法",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/18 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:0": "糟了！\n跟艾咪走散了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/18 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:1": "那個機器人，\n難道是往艾咪那邊去了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/18 After Twinkle Park/Japanese.txt:2": "得快點找到艾咪才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/19 Amy Kidnapped/Japanese.txt:0": "艾咪不在這裡……\n她跑到哪去了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/19 Amy Kidnapped/Japanese.txt:1": "啊～嗚！\n索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/19 Amy Kidnapped/Japanese.txt:2": "糟了！艾咪她！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:0": "放我下來！快放我下來啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:1": "蛋頭博士的機器人！\n艾咪我就帶回去囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:3": "這是……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:4": "站住！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:5": "索尼克──！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/20 Before Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:6": "又冒出來了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/21 This is the Ancient Light/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「太古之光」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/21 This is the Ancient Light/Japanese.txt:1": "朝著敵人\n使出光速衝刺的話……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/21 This is the Ancient Light/Japanese.txt:2": "就能發動必殺技\n「光速迴旋攻擊」喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/22 After Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:0": "索尼克～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/22 After Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:1": "塔爾斯！\n你沒事啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/22 After Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:2": "好，塔爾斯！\n去追蛋頭母艦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/22 After Red Mountain/Japanese.txt:3": "追上去囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:0": "鑽進去了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:1": "塔爾斯！\n降落在蛋頭母艦上！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:2": "嗯！……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:3": "糟了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:4": "怎麼了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:5": "變形之後\n就沒有起落架了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/23 After Sky Chase Act 2/Japanese.txt:6": "什麼──！！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/24 On Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:0": "ＷＯＷ！近看之後\n更覺得這東西誇張了",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/24 On Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:1": "索尼克！別光顧著讚嘆，\n快點去找艾咪啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/24 On Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:2": "對喔。\n好，Ｈｅｒｅ ｗｅ ｇｏ！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/25 Eggman Transforms the Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:0": "別得意忘形了，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/25 Eggman Transforms the Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:1": "就讓你見識我的萬能空中要塞\n蛋頭母艦的真面目！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/25 Eggman Transforms the Egg Carrier/Japanese.txt:2": "啊，按下去～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:0": "好厲害！變形了耶！\n吶吶，你看到剛才那個了嗎！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:1": "Ｓｈｏｏｔ！這樣就\n沒辦法去艦橋了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:2": "……好過分喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:3": "哇～哈哈哈！\n看到了吧、聽到了吧、嚇到了吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:4": "索尼克！想來這裡的話，\n就先穿越『天空甲板』吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:5": "不過！你到底\n有沒有那個本事呢？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:6": "哇～哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/26 After Transform/Japanese.txt:7": "有意思！我就做給你看！\nＣＯＭＥ ＯＮ！！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/27 Sky Deck Entrance/Japanese.txt:0": "前面就是\n那傢伙說的『天空甲板』嗎……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/28 After Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:0": "什麼嘛，這樣就結束了？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/28 After Sky Deck/Japanese.txt:1": "艦橋那邊比較可疑。\n索尼克，我們上去看看吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "哼，太慢了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "遵命，蛋頭博士。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "剩下的就交給你了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "小鳥！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "是混沌翡翠！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "怎麼會……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "只要有了這個，就不需要妳了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "Gamma！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "有何吩咐，蛋頭博士？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "把那隻藍色刺蝟\n打成蜂窩！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/29 Before Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "讓我看看你的訓練成果！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "住手，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "艾咪！？……讓開！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "可不能放著\n那傢伙不管！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "這個機器人\n不是壞人喔？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "……住手！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "艾咪……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "知道了啦……\n看來好像有什麼隱情。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "吶，索尼克！\n這艘船的高度一直在往下掉耶！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "沒時間了！塔爾斯，\n你帶著艾咪先逃出去！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "那索尼克你呢？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/30 After Gamma Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "我去追蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/31 Find the switch/Japanese.txt:0": "要往前走的話，\n就得讓這艘船再變形一次嗎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/31 Find the switch/Japanese.txt:1": "開關的話……艦橋那邊很可疑！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/32 Monorails are online/Japanese.txt:0": "緊急狀態已解除。\n單軌電車恢復正常運行。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "來不及了嗎……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "卡歐斯……這就是那個卡歐斯嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "復活時分裂出去的卡歐斯尾巴，\n也已經回到牠身上了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "混沌翡翠只剩下最後一顆！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "我不會讓你稱心如意的，\n蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:13": "哼！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "就算只有６顆翡翠，\n要打倒區區索尼克也綽綽有餘！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "上吧，卡歐斯！\n把那傢伙收拾掉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "哇──哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "成功了！很好！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "青、青蛙君～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "得、得去救青蛙君才行～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "那隻青蛙是你的朋友嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "好！交給我吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/33 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "混沌翡翠已經收集到６顆了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/34 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "咿！怎……怎麼可能……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/34 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "唷，納克魯斯。你來晚啦！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/34 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "已經解決囉。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/34 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "永別了，索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/34 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "蛋頭博士！站住！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/35 Before Lost World/Japanese.txt:0": "Ｄａｒｎ ｉｔ！\n可惡的蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/35 Before Lost World/Japanese.txt:1": "這裡是……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/35 Before Lost World/Japanese.txt:4": "是在引誘我嗎……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/36 After Lost World/Japanese.txt:0": "這是……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/36 After Lost World/Japanese.txt:1": "壁畫……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/37 Tikal Flasback (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "Ｗｈａｔ？\n這是怎麼回事",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/37 Tikal Flasback (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "這裡到底是哪裡！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/38 Tikal Flasback (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "為什麼……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/38 Tikal Flasback (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "為什麼\n事情會變成這樣……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/38 Tikal Flasback (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "為什麼……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/38 Tikal Flasback (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "不行……！\n得阻止才行……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/39 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:0": "……剛才那是怎麼回事？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/39 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:1": "不是……在做夢吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/39 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:4": "沒想到你會特地現身啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/39 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:5": "這次不會再讓你逃掉了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/40 Before Egg Viper Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "可惡的索尼克！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/40 Before Egg Viper Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "竟然追到這種地方來了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/40 Before Egg Viper Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "站住，蛋頭博士！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/41 This is the Crystal Ring/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「水晶環」呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Sonic/41 This is the Crystal Ring/Japanese.txt:1": "累積光速衝刺力量的時間\n應該會變短喔。"
}